# GNU Stow ignore list.
#
# NOTE: Stow anchors every one of these regexes at BOTH ends, so a bare
# `\.in$` never matches anything -- each pattern must describe the whole
# path segment. That is why they all start with `.*`.
#
# Templates and shipped defaults must not be symlinked into $HOME: Install.sh
# renders the .in templates (they contain @HOME@, which no config format
# expands on its own) and seeds the .default files without clobbering a user's
# own edits.
.*\.in
.*\.default
.*\.bak
\.stow-local-ignore
__pycache__
.*\.pyc
